Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:43.25,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 美网 男单资格赛决胜轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:43.25,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}坂本怜 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(3){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 锦织圭 · 赛后告别仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.38,EN,,0,0,0,,right now I'd like to take a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在，让我们花一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to celebrate an incredible career.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,致敬这段非凡的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Kei Nishikori has a special history
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,锦织圭与纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,有着一段特别缘分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.18,EN,,0,0,0,,In 2014, he made history at the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,2014年，他在美网创造历史
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Open as the first Asian man
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,首位做到这一点的亚洲男将
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:18.18,EN,,0,0,0,,to reach a Grand Slam singles final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,闯进大满贯男单决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:24.44,EN,,0,0,0,,He went on to reach world number four,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来又升至世界第四
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:26.04,EN,,0,0,0,,win 12 ATP titles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:26.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢得12座ATP冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and an Olympic bronze medal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及一枚奥运铜牌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,He inspired fans around the world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,他激励了全球球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,with his talent and resilience.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,凭借天赋与韧性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:37.42,EN,,0,0,0,,So with that, Kei, please come up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:37.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么，圭，请上场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,来到我们身边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:46.57,EN,,0,0,0,,Kei, not the way that you wanted to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:46.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,圭，这不是你想要的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:50.23,EN,,0,0,0,,but look around you and look at this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:50.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,但请看看四周的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:51.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Unforgettable moments you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:51.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在纽约留下过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:53.31,EN,,0,0,0,,have had in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:53.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多难忘的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:56.09,EN,,0,0,0,,What does New York mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:56.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,纽约对你意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.53,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, thanks to the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.53,0:01:00.53,EN,,0,0,0,,you guys, for giving me the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.53,0:01:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢你们给我机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:02.35,EN,,0,0,0,,to play this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:02.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我参加本周的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:03.39,EN,,0,0,0,,And I was really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:03.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:05.09,EN,,0,0,0,,to play these three matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,能打完这三场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:08.81,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy to lose today, but I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:08.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天输球当然遗憾，不过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:11.53,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:11.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也替怜感到高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.33,EN,,0,0,0,,He's the next Japanese top player,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,他是日本的下一位顶尖球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:18.47,EN,,0,0,0,,so I hope he can make top ten soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:18.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望他很快打进前十
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:21.17,EN,,0,0,0,,But it was a great, great week for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:21.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说，这仍是精彩的一周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:22.89,EN,,0,0,0,,I was really enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很享受这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:24.73,EN,,0,0,0,,Great week, but an incredible,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:24.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周很棒，而你的生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:26.87,EN,,0,0,0,,fantastic career for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:26.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,更是无比辉煌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:27.75,EN,,0,0,0,,As I mentioned, some
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:27.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,正如刚才所说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:30.09,EN,,0,0,0,,of your accolades final here at the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:30.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,你曾打进美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:32.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Open. Former world number four,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:32.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,也曾升至世界第四
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.77,0:01:34.05,EN,,0,0,0,,you know what you have meant
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.77,0:01:34.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道自己对网球世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.65,EN,,0,0,0,,to the world of tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:37.47,EN,,0,0,0,,I would love for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:37.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想请你说几句
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:40.59,EN,,0,0,0,,They love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:40.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们真的太爱你了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.59,0:01:41.95,EN,,0,0,0,,What would you like to say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.59,0:01:41.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想对世界各地的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:45.59,EN,,0,0,0,,to your fans all around the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:45.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,说些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:46.31,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:46.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:49.75,EN,,0,0,0,,I really enjoyed my entire tennis life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很享受整个网球生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:52.83,EN,,0,0,0,,It was almost 20 years in the pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:52.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,在职业赛场近20年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.83,0:01:56.37,EN,,0,0,0,,And especially here, I had great memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.83,0:01:56.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其在这里，回忆太多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:02:00.11,EN,,0,0,0,,One final, semis, and many,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:02:00.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,一次决赛、两次半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:02.57,EN,,0,0,0,,many great matches I played here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有许多纽约的精彩比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:04.23,EN,,0,0,0,,In New York,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:04.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,如今我又站在纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:07.95,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to play this last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:07.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴能在这里打完这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:10.81,EN,,0,0,0,,And I have one more tournament to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:10.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只剩最后一站比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:13.11,EN,,0,0,0,,so I hope I can do well in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:13.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望能在日本打好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.05,EN,,0,0,0,,And speaking of the Asian community,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,说到亚裔群体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:15.57,EN,,0,0,0,,would you like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:15.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,你愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:16.95,EN,,0,0,0,,to say something in Japanese
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:16.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,用日语说几句吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:18.77,EN,,0,0,0,,to the big Asian community here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:18.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,对现场的亚裔球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:20.59,EN,,0,0,0,,especially your Japanese fans,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:20.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别是日本球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:22.70,EN,,0,0,0,,for coming out and supporting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:22.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢他们前来支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:26.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Speaking in Japanese,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:26.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,（以下为日语发言）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:38.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Kei thanks the fans for their support.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:38.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,（锦织圭感谢球迷一路支持）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:55.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you so much once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,再次非常感谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.66,EN,,0,0,0,,But before you get off the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过在你离场前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to turn things over to our U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想把话筒交给
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Open Tournament Director, Eric Butorac.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,美网总监埃里克·布托拉克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:07.56,EN,,0,0,0,,And also, of course, our USTA CEO,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及美国网协首席执行官
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:09.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Craig Tiley, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:09.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,克雷格·泰利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:11.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Michelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，米歇尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Kei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你，圭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:14.60,EN,,0,0,0,,On a great career.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:14.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的职业生涯太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:16.60,EN,,0,0,0,,It's an honor for us to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们很荣幸你能来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.18,EN,,0,0,0,,I think many people know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想很多人都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.38,EN,,0,0,0,,about your great level of tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的球技有多出色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:20.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I think what they don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:20.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,但他们可能不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,is what a great human you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你更是个了不起的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.34,EN,,0,0,0,,We've worked with you for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们与你共事多年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:24.66,EN,,0,0,0,,It's always a pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:24.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,始终都非常愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's a pleasure for us to host you here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在这里见证
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:27.86,EN,,0,0,0,,for your final match at the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:27.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的最后一场美网比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:30.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我们的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,A true champion, Kei Nishikori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,真正的冠军，锦织圭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:37.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:37.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:40.08,EN,,0,0,0,,One more round
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,再一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of applause for Kei Nishikori,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,把掌声送给锦织圭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:45.94,EN,,0,0,0,,as he has done incredible things here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:45.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,他在这里创造太多传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:46.82,EN,,0,0,0,,at the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:46.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,在美网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.82,0:03:49.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Open and the world of tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.82,0:03:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,也在整个网球世界
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:51.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Let him hear it, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:51.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,让他听见你们的掌声
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:04:35.49,EN,,0,0,0,,A beautiful moment for the world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:04:35.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是属于网球世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:36.79,EN,,0,0,0,,of tennis right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:36.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,此刻最美的一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:40.57,EN,,0,0,0,,for sticking around, for seeing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:40.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,留下来见证这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:43.25,EN,,0,0,0,,Kei Nishikori, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,锦织圭，感谢你
